#: ../../../developer/debugging/automated-tests.rst:18
#: 53507286216c411d887375371df9c495
msgid ""
"Integration tests are written with the assumption that they will be executed "
"on dedicated hardware and must be run in dom0. All other unit tests can also "
"be run in dom0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/debugging/automated-tests.rst:20
#: 100f4e22a4484c74b3b29ea2565652ee
msgid ""
"**Do not run the tests on installations with important data, because you "
"might lose it.**"
msgstr ""

